1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,280
Most ICPs are built on assumptions.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:04,660
The best ones are built on closed-won

3
00:00:04,740 --> 00:00:05,080
data.

4
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:08,580
The traditional ICP exercise starts with

5
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:09,160
a whiteboard.

6
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:11,160
Who do we think we sell best to?

7
00:00:11,910 --> 00:00:13,920
What industries, company sizes, and

8
00:00:13,970 --> 00:00:15,660
