16
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:31,980
Which firmographic combinations convert

17
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:32,800
at the highest rate.

18
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:35,460
Which personas are present in every deal

19
00:00:35,510 --> 00:00:37,080
that closes in under sixty days.

20
00:00:37,830 --> 00:00:39,140
Which industries have the highest

21
00:00:39,190 --> 00:00:40,850
average contract value and the lowest

22
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:41,410
churn rate.

23
00:00:41,960 --> 00:00:44,440
The ICP stops being a belief system and

24
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:46,310
becomes a data-driven targeting model.

25
00:00:47,070 --> 00:00:48,900
It updates as new deals close and the

26
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:49,680
