31
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,840
That is not a marginal improvement in

32
00:01:00,890 --> 00:01:01,310
targeting.

33
00:01:01,750 --> 00:01:03,260
That is a structural advantage in

34
00:01:03,340 --> 00:01:04,380
pipeline generation.

35
00:01:05,100 --> 00:01:07,610
Follow A-Gent for the agent-first GTM

36
00:01:07,670 --> 00:01:08,100
